---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "فريق التحرير | EduNews"
lang: ar
language: ar
permalink: "/ar/فريق-التحرير/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
  Static page — edit the header/CTA text below directly.
  Replaces the "editorial-team" (ar) entry that used to live in
  src/_data/sitePages.js. The roster itself still comes from the site-wide
  `authors` collection (same as author-profile.njk uses), filtered to
  language == "ar" — that part stays dynamic on purpose.
  Styling comes entirely from main.css (.feed-page, .feed-header, .feed-grid,
  .static-card, .team-*, .static-cta, .pill-btn) — don't add styles here.
#}
{% set authorBase = '/ar/authors/' %}
{% set team = [] %}
{% for a in authors %}{% if a.language == 'ar' %}{% set _ = team.push(a) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}

<div class="feed-page static-page static-page--team" data-translation-url="/en/editorial-team/">

    <header class="feed-header">
        <h1 class="feed-title feed-title-topic">فريق التحرير</h1>
        <p class="feed-lead">الصحفيون والكتّاب الذين يقفون وراء تغطيتنا.</p>
    </header>

    {% if team.length %}
    <div class="feed-grid">
        {% for a in team %}
        {% set name = a.name_ar or a.name_en %}
        {% set role = a.role_ar or a.role_en %}
        <div class="feed-item">
            <article class="static-card team-card">
                {% if a.avatarUrl %}
                <img class="author-profile-avatar" src="{{ a.avatarUrl }}?w=240&h=240&fit=crop" alt="" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy">
                {% else %}
                <span class="author-profile-avatar team-initial" aria-hidden="true">{{ name | first }}</span>
                {% endif %}
                <h2 class="team-name"><a href="{{ authorBase }}{{ a.slug }}/">{{ name }}</a></h2>
                {% if role %}<p class="team-role">{{ role }}</p>{% endif %}
            </article>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="feed-empty"><p class="feed-empty-text">سيظهر فريق التحرير هنا قريبًا.</p></div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="feature-reading-column">
        <div class="static-cta">
            <p>لديك خبر أو ملاحظة؟ راسل التحرير مباشرة.</p>
            <a href="mailto:editorial@edunews.example" class="pill-btn">راسل التحرير <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i></a>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
